th people to  stay home  i know it's a major sacrifice and an  economic and emotional sacrifice  but please be certain it will not be in  vain  an authorities fear the next two weeks  could be particularly severe  as colombia's struggles with another  expected surge  alessandra al jazeera bogota
 

